      "summaries": {
        "en": "bitchat is a Bluetooth mesh chat app providing decentralized, end-to-end encrypted messaging for iOS and macOS without internet, evoking IRC-style simplicity. Its core strength lies in combining Multipeer Connectivity's device pairing with Nostr's relay mechanism to create a robust mesh network that works offline. You can use it for local group chats at events, secure communication during outages, or as a template for building resilient peer-to-peer apps.",
        "zh": "bitchat 是一款基于蓝牙 Mesh 网络的去中心化聊天应用，支持端到端加密，无需互联网即可在 iOS 和 macOS 设备间通信，风格类似 IRC。其技术核心是结合 Apple 的 Multipeer Connectivity 框架进行设备发现，并利用 Nostr 协议实现消息的去中心化中继，形成自组织的弹性网络。你可以将其用于户外活动、网络中断时的本地群聊，或作为构建安全、点对点应用的参考实现。项目采用 Unlicense 许可，鼓励自由使用和修改。",
        "es": "bitchat is a Bluetooth mesh chat app providing decentralized, end-to-end encrypted messaging for iOS and macOS without internet, evoking IRC-style simplicity. Its core strength lies in combining Multipeer Connectivity's device pairing with Nostr's relay mechanism to create a robust mesh network that works offline. You can use it for local group chats at events, secure communication during outages, or as a template for building resilient peer-to-peer apps.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "bitchat stands out for bluetooth, bluetooth-le, and decentralized in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "bitchat is a Bluetooth mesh chat app providing decentralized, end-to-end encrypted messaging for iOS and macOS without internet, evoking IRC-style simplicity. Its core strength lies in combining Multipeer Connectivity's device pairing with Nostr's relay mechanism to create a robust mesh network that works offline. You can use it for local group chats at events, secure communication during outages, or as a template for building resilient peer-to-peer apps.",
