      "summaries": {
        "en": "Jenkins is an open-source automation server that streamlines continuous integration and delivery (CI/CD). It excels at building, testing, and deploying software pipelines as code, allowing teams to automate repetitive tasks. Its strength lies in a vast plugin ecosystem, enabling integration with virtually any tool. Typical use cases include automated testing, code quality checks, and deployment to production. Developers can define pipelines via Groovy DSL, making it highly customizable.",
        "zh": "Jenkins 是一个开源的自动化服务器，专为持续集成与持续交付（CI/CD）而设计。它的核心能力是将构建、测试、部署等流程定义为代码（Pipeline as Code），通过 Groovy 脚本灵活编排。其最大优势在于拥有庞大的插件生态，几乎能与所有开发工具无缝集成。典型应用场景包括自动化测试、代码质量检查、多环境部署等。团队可通过声明式或脚本化流水线轻松定制工作流，实现从代码提交到上线的全自动化。",
        "es": "Jenkins is an open-source automation server that streamlines continuous integration and delivery (CI/CD). It excels at building, testing, and deploying software pipelines as code, allowing teams to automate repetitive tasks. Its strength lies in a vast plugin ecosystem, enabling integration with virtually any tool. Typical use cases include automated testing, code quality checks, and deployment to production. Developers can define pipelines via Groovy DSL, making it highly customizable.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "jenkins stands out for cicd, continuous-delivery, and continuous-deployment in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Jenkins is an open-source automation server that streamlines continuous integration and delivery (CI/CD). It excels at building, testing, and deploying software pipelines as code, allowing teams to automate repetitive tasks. Its strength lies in a vast plugin ecosystem, enabling integration with virtually any tool. Typical use cases include automated testing, code quality checks, and deployment to production. Developers can define pipelines via Groovy DSL, making it highly customizable.",
