      "summaries": {
        "en": "Open-Code-Review is a hybrid code review tool that combines deterministic pipelines with LLM agents, battle-tested at Alibaba scale. Its key technical insight is the synergy: rule-based checks (NPE, XSS, SQL injection) catch low-level issues precisely, while the LLM understands context for higher-level concerns like logic errors or design smells. The tool outputs line-level comments, making reviews actionable. You can deploy it as a GitHub or GitLab bot, or integrate via API. Use it to automate thorough, context-aware code reviews in your CI/CD pipeline.",
        "zh": "Open-Code-Review是阿里巴巴开源的混合架构代码审查工具，结合确定性流水线与LLM代理。规则引擎精准检测空指针、SQL注入等低级问题，大语言模型负责理解上下文，发现逻辑缺陷与设计异味。两者互补，输出行级评论，可直接部署为GitHub/GitLab机器人或通过API集成CI/CD。该工具适合大规模项目，在保障基础合规的同时捕捉复杂语义问题，配置OpenAI/Anthropic兼容API即可体验。",
        "es": "Open-Code-Review is a hybrid code review tool that combines deterministic pipelines with LLM agents, battle-tested at Alibaba scale. Its key technical insight is the synergy: rule-based checks (NPE, XSS, SQL injection) catch low-level issues precisely, while the LLM understands context for higher-level concerns like logic errors or design smells. The tool outputs line-level comments, making reviews actionable. You can deploy it as a GitHub or GitLab bot, or integrate via API. Use it to automate thorough, context-aware code reviews in your CI/CD pipeline.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "open-code-review stands out for agent, agent-skills, and code-review in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Open-Code-Review is a hybrid code review tool that combines deterministic pipelines with LLM agents, battle-tested at Alibaba scale. Its key technical insight is the synergy: rule-based checks (NPE, XSS, SQL injection) catch low-level issues precisely, while the LLM understands context for higher-level concerns like logic errors or design smells. The tool outputs line-level comments, making reviews actionable. You can deploy it as a GitHub or GitLab bot, or integrate via API. Use it to automate thorough, context-aware code reviews in your CI/CD pipeline.",
