        "es": "Amnezia VPN Client is an open-source, cross-platform VPN tool designed to bypass censorship and protect privacy. It uniquely supports multiple protocols including OpenVPN, WireGuard, Shadowsocks, IKEv2, and Cloak obfuscation, making it adaptable to restrictive networks. You can use it by downloading the client, setting up your own server via the included server installer, or importing custom configurations for instant secure browsing.",
